@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@jwt = {{jwt}}
@requestId = {{requestId}}
@alertId = {{alertId}}

### Listar alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Listar alertas paginadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/page?status=PENDIENTE&type=LOW_BATTERY&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt&direction=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Obtener alerta por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Filtrar alertas por estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/status/PENDIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Filtrar alertas por tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/type/LOW_BATTERY
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Cola de prioridad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/pending/priority-queue?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Actualizar alerta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

{
  "status": "PENDIENTE",
  "observations": "Actualizada desde IntelliJ HTTP Client"
}

### Resolver alerta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve?observations=Resuelta%20desde%20HTTP%20Client
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Descartar alerta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/discard?observations=Descartada%20desde%20HTTP%20Client
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
